  "anti_oracle_erasure_rules": [
    "Load and hash-check the manifest, contract and frozen oracle suite before constructing any control or mutant.",
    "Treat the contract and oracle suite as immutable inputs; apply every operation to a fresh clone of an observation, never to an expectation or oracle object.",
    "Reject an operation that targets an absent case, profile, probe or observable; do not skip it and do not weaken its witness set.",
    "Every semantic source and target observation must be complete before mutation; oracle_not_frozen, timeout, missing product, ambiguous identity, unsupported parser construction or incomplete observation makes the discrimination run fail before classification.",
