    "If mutant construction or witness extraction fails, report harness_error and block the seal; never coerce that failure to Unknown, Preserved or Violated.",
    "Opaque controls are built only from opaque_calibration_cases and cannot be used as sources for semantic mutations.",
    "The positive control is identity-only; any mutation of it is harness_error and blocks the seal."
  ],
